                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "12613217",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197996495980",
                            "num_reviews": 211,
                            "playtime_forever": 1041,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 1041,
                            "last_played": 1412920602
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a very fun and addictive turn-based tactical/strategy game with RPG elements.  Slay monsters, collect loot, expand your army, and replace your fallen comrades with clones of either friends or foes.  And all this driven by a charming & funny story.  \n\nOne of my favorite features is the ability to switch your hero's equipment on the fly without taking up a turn.  Tactical strategy veterans may scoff at this, but I found it quite refreshing - and this potentially unbalancing feature is easily kept in check by your desire to go on instead of opening the inventory every turn.\n\nSome people may get too annoyed by environmental hazards like falling rocks or collapsing ground - but they probably didn't pay attention to the warning signs you see the turn before it happens, which gives you time to move your party to a safe place.  And since you have the ability to enter tactical mode and move each unit by 1 space within a single turn, it's not unfair.\n\nThe game is very good, get it!",
